---json
{
  "layout": "layouts/story.njk",
  "permalink": "/pages/workflows-regions.html",
  "bodyClass": "page-story",
  "hero": {
    "eyebrow": "Worldwide",
    "heading": "Choose your region.",
    "lede": "Quickler works anywhere WhatsApp does. Pick a continent, then a country, to find guides for your market.",
    "actions": [
      {
        "label": "UK guides",
        "href": "/pages/guides.html",
        "style": "btn-primary"
      },
      {
        "label": "Workflows",
        "href": "/pages/services.html",
        "style": "btn-secondary"
      }
    ]
  },
  "seo": {
    "title": "Quickler by Region | Field Compliance Worldwide",
    "description": "Quickler guides by region. Pick your continent and country to find guides for your market.",
    "canonical": "https://quickler.co/pages/workflows-regions.html",
    "lang": "en"
  },
  "scripts": [
    "/js/analytics-events.js"
  ]
}
---
{#- Continent links as a real .story snap panel so each link is reliably
    tappable on touch (links in a story-seo tail get snapped away). -#}
<section class="story story-feature">
  <div class="story-inner">
    <p class="story-eyebrow">By continent</p>
    <h2 class="story-h2">Field compliance by region.</h2>
    <p class="story-text">Quickler Ltd is registered in Scotland and the service works anywhere WhatsApp does. The person on site answers by voice note, text or photo, and nobody has to install a new app. Reports are kept on secure servers in the European Union. Quickler is £75 a month for each phone number, with a 14-day free trial and no card needed.</p>
    <div class="story-tags">
      {%- for cont in continentList %}
      <a href="/pages/continent-{{ cont.slug }}.html" class="story-tag">{{ cont.name }} <span class="story-tag-count">{{ cont.count }}</span></a>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="story story-cta">
  <div class="story-inner">
    <p class="story-eyebrow">In the UK?</p>
    <h2 class="story-h2">Start with the UK library.</h2>
    <p class="story-text story-text-centre">The UK is our home market. Guides, templates and checklists are here.</p>
    <div class="story-actions">
      <a href="/pages/guides.html" class="btn btn-primary">UK guides and templates</a>
      <a href="/pages/services.html" class="btn btn-secondary">Workflows</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
